Third-party code and data in photos-mcp, with their licences.

1. gpwc (Google Photos web client)
   https://github.com/xob0t/google_photos_web_client, commit 651aa268d50529cb6128c8a42c9cd4ce668f2189
   A modified subset is vendored in src/photos_mcp/vendor/gpwc/ (changes listed in its README.md);
   the response parsers in src/photos_mcp/rpc.py follow its parser.py.

2. Google-Photos-Toolkit (GPTK)
   https://github.com/xob0t/Google-Photos-Toolkit, commit 6db9ab355e4797327e4078cf87a2b6994d36cf73
   The parser fixtures in tests/fixtures/*.json derive from its anonymised parser fixtures
   (tests/fixtures/README.md); the field paths in src/photos_mcp/rpc.py and docs/PAYLOADS.md
   follow its parser.

